        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati n'abantu be bwe baajaayo okutoolayo omunhago, baayagaanayo eby'obukombe kamaala, n'engoye, n'ebintu eby'omughendo, baatwalaku bye baasobola, ebindi byabalemeragho. Baamala enaku isatu nga bakaasomba omunhago ogwo, kuba gwali mungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwokuna beesololeza mu kiiko kya Beraka, baasaaka Musengwa Katonda. Era okuva ku olwo ekifo ekyo kyayetebwanga ekiiko kya Beraka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:26:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Beraka:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Eriina lino mu Luheburayi litegeeza “Kusaaka.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yehoshafati yaakulembera abantu boonaboona ab'omu Buyudaaya n'ab'omu Yerusalemu, bairayo e Yerusalemu nga basangaavu, kuba Musengwa Katonda yaghangula abazigu baibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baatuuka e Yerusalemu, baaja mu isinzizo nga bali kukuba entongooli n'endingidi, eno nga bwe bafuuwa n'amagwala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ab'omu bwakyabazinga obw'ensi dhoonadhoona bwe baawulira nga Musengwa Katonda alwaniisa abazigu ba Isiraeli, baatya inho Katonda oyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale obwakyabazinga bwa Yehoshafati bwaba bwa miraala, kuba Katonda yamugha emiraala ku ndhuyi dhoonadhoona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati yafuuka kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya ng'agheza emyaka amakumi asatu n'etaanu egy'obukulu, era yaafugira entangama ya myaka amakumi abiri n'etaanu mu Yerusalemu. Inhina yali nga ni Azuba, mughala wa Shilihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati oyo yali wa mpisa nkalamu era nga tadhivaaku, ng'oti ni lata we Asa bweyali. Yaakolanga ebirungi Musengwa Katonda by'asiima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ebifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu tiyabitoolagho. Abantu baasigala nga bakaali kwemalira ku kugheereza Katonda wa badhaadha baibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindi byonabyona Yehoshafati bye yakola, okuva lwe yatoolera okufuga okutuuka lwe yakoma, byaghandiikibwa mu kitabo kya Yehu mutabane wa Hanani, era byamala byaingizibwa mu kitabo eky'Ebyafaayo bya Bakyabazinga ba Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo nga biwoire, kyabazinga Yehoshafati oyo owa Buyudaaya, yeeyimba ni kyabazinga Ahazia owa Isiraeli eyakola ebibi kamaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakola naye amaato ag'okujanga e Tarushishi, nga bagakolera mu Ezionigeberi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Eliezeri mutabane wa Dodavahu ow'e Maresha, yaalanga ng'alabula Yehoshafati ati: “Nga bwe weeyimbye ni Ahazia, Musengwa Katonda aidha kuzikiriza by'okoze.” Kale amaato ago gaamenhekera mu nhandha, gaaloba kusobola kuja e Tarushishi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
